      "title": "Where Did the Crossing Occur?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_1",
          "text": "The chapter carefully names Pihahiroth, Migdol, Baal-zephon, and the sea as Israel\u2019s camping place. Those names preserve the narrative\u2019s route and setting, but identifying each site on a modern map\u2014and therefore locating the crossing precisely\u2014remains disputed. The passage itself supplies the sequence of places without settling every modern reconstruction.",
